    "wp": {
      "status": "needs-revision",
      "comment": "I think the segmentation is largely correct. A few tricky parts: \n(a) This order cites another order than declares an Emergency and cites as authority the IEEPA, so I wasn't sure whether the order_actions should be classified as emergency or not. \n(b) There is boilerplate at the bottom that says no right or benefit, but the order sounds in having a legal effect for the most part (prohibitions in section 1). \n(c) Trouble deciding whether to classify as foreign or domestic because some of them are about US citizens interactions with foreign persons or entities. \n(d) I think the segmentation might need some work. For order_action #6 and #7 are related, even if they both use ordering phrases. I find -> then determine. Worth clarifying whether the finding has legal effect. "
    }
